		{"id":"f9724bedef529c95","type":"text","text":"Local Login (Default Root User)\n```\nmysql -u root -p\n```\n\nLog in Directly to a Specific Database\n```\nmysql -u root -p database_name\n```\n\nRemote Server Login\n```\nmysql -u username -p -h 192.168.1.100 -P 3306\n```\n\nBasic MySQL Quick-Start Commands\n- **`SHOW DATABASES;`** - Lists all databases available to your user account.\n- **`USE database_name;`** - Selects a database to start working with it.\n- **`SHOW TABLES;`** - Lists all the tables inside your selected database.\n- **`EXIT;`** or **`QUIT;`** - Safely disconnects you from the MySQL server\n\n```\nmysql -u root -p -h IP\nmysql -u root -p -h IP --skip-ssl\n```","x":-680,"y":380,"width":600,"height":612},
		{"id":"c5fe8f767998bb51","type":"text","text":"`hydra -C wordlist mysql://IP `","x":-700,"y":220,"width":260,"height":60},
		{"id":"5f207006d45d2fec","x":-969,"y":39,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Dictionary Attack\n`jab username hoga tabhi`"},
		{"id":"902b1f2a87f93a70","x":-980,"y":-90,"width":354,"height":52,"type":"text","text":"MYSQL se user password hi nikal sakate h"},
		{"id":"149947b2133a1a49","x":315,"y":208,"width":545,"height":125,"type":"text","text":"sqlcmd -S <server_name_or_IP> -U `<username>` -P `<password>`\n\nsqlcmd -S <server_name_or_IP> -U `<username>`\n\nsearch on google"}
	],
